[140.049736, "i", "cat > /home/user/logpipe/BUGFIX_SUMMARY.md << 'EOF'\n# Log Filter Bug Fix Summary\n\n## Problem\nPayment service ERROR logs were being dropped (not appearing in errors.log) while auth-service and inventory-service ERROR logs were processed correctly.\n\n## Root Cause\nThe `classify_line()` function in filter.py had an overly broad check for \"structured\" logs:\n\n```python\nif 'T' in line[:25] and ':' in line[:25]:\n    return 'structured'\n```\n\nThis check was intended to identify structured/JSON logs but incorrectly matched ISO 8601 timestamps like `2024-01-15T08:48:40+00:00`.\n\n## Why Only Payment Service Was Affected\n- **payment-svc**: Uses ISO 8601 timestamps: `2024-01-15T08:48:40+00:00 [ERROR] ...`\n- **auth-service**: Uses space-separated timestamps: `[ERROR] 2024-01-15 08:09:25 ...`\n- **inventory-service**: Uses space-separated timestamps: `[ERROR] 2024-01-15 08:30:16 ...`\n\nPayment-svc logs were misclassified as \"structured\" and routed to structured.log instead of being processed for severity-based routing to errors."]
[140.049869, "i", "log.\n\n## Solution\nModified `classify_line()` to only identify actual JSON logs:\n\n```python\ndef classify_line(line):\n    # Check for actual JSON only\n    stripped = line.strip()\n    if stripped.startswith('{') and stripped.endswith('}'):\n        return 'structured'\n    return 'plaintext'\n```\n\n## Results\n- Before fix: 0 payment-svc ERROR logs in errors.log\n- After fix: 76 payment-svc ERROR logs correctly routed to errors.log\n- Other services: Still working correctly (23 auth-service, 28 inventory-service)\n- Structured logs: Still properly captured (5 JSON logs from metrics-collector)\n\n## Files Modified\n- `/home/user/logpipe/filter.py` - Fixed classify_line() function\n- Backup created: `/home/user/logpipe/filter.py.backup`\nEOF\n"]
[140.049955, "o", "cat > /home/user/logpipe/BUGFIX_SUMMARY.md << 'EOF'\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
